शट् शट्, cl. 1. P. शटति, शटितुम्, to be
sick or diseased; to divide, separate, pierce;
to be dissolved; to be weary or dejected; to go;
cl. 10. A. शाटयते, -यितुम्, to praise, flatter (= rt.
1. शठ्).

सट्ट् सट्ट्, cl. 10. P. सट्टयति, -यितुम्, to
hurt, injure, kill; to be strong or powerful;
to give; to take; to dwell, inhabit.
